[[16,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3237461\">1016A42</a></p><p>1. Disconnect electric connection from ignition coils.</p><p>2. Remove cable fastener brackets and move  wiring harness out of\nplace.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Ignition coil</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235073\">A30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018644.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[16,127,0,"<p>Unscrew remaining fixing screws (1a) from\nignition coils (1b) and remove them.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018645.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[16,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position ignition coils, insert fixing\nscrews and free holes for cable fastener brackets.</p><p>Reassembly wiring harness and its cable\nfastener brackets, connect electric connections and close in pair\nignition coil fixing screws.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>IGNITION COIL/REEL</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.57 - 0.89</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3237461\">1016A42</a></p>"]]